66 16.0976 14.6834 16.0976 14.2929 15.7071L10 11.4142L5.70711 15.7071C5.31658 16.0976 4.68342 16.0976 4.29289 15.7071C3.90237 15.3166 3.90237 14.6834 4.29289 14.2929L8.58579 10L4.29289 5.70711C3.90237 5.31658 3.90237 4.68342 4.29289 4.29289Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></button></section><a class="affiliate-banner affiliate-banner-custom" href="https://url-shortener.curseforge.com/JywCa" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Affiliate Banner"><img src="https://media.forgecdn.net/banner/console-affiliation-banners/banner_8a9a2ce5-956d-489e-9b46-b41a133d67e5.png" alt="affiliate banner image"/></a><section><div class=" project-description"><p>With this mod as well as the BetterEnd Fabric mod installed, the end cities that generate will be much more intricate in design and will include the wood types and some decorations from the BetterEnd mod.</p>
<p>The end cities will also include more loot as each loot room has more chests.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>This mod is a perfect addition to any modpack that includes BetterEnd Fabric.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>For compatibility with "Lootr", You must download and use this datapack: <a href="/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fdata-pack%252flootr-compatibility-pack-for-betterend-fabric%252f" rel="nofollow">Lootr Compatibility Pack for BetterEnd Fabric Minecraft Data Pack (planetminecraft.com)</a></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>An example of the cities can be seen below:</p>
<p><img src="https://static.planetminecraft.com/files/image/minecraft/data-pack/2022/896/15572481-betterendcitiesthumbnail_l.webp" alt="Example of BetterEnd Better End Cities" width="800" height="506"></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>Also try&nbsp;<a href="https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bigger-better-end-cities" rel="nofollow">Bigger Better End Cities - Mods - Minecraft - CurseForge</a></p>
<p>To have much bigger cities.</p>
<p><br>If a datapack version of this mod is preferable, it can be found here:</p>
<p><a href="https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-end-city-for-better-end" target="_blank" rel="nofollow">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-end-city-for-better-end</a></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>For a version for Vanilla try:</p>
<p><a href="https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-end-cities-vanilla" rel="nofollow">Better End Cities Vanilla - Mods - Minecraft - CurseForge</a></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p></div></section><section class="project-team"><h2>Better End Cities Better End Team</h2><div class="author"><div class="avatar-container"><span role="img" aria-label="Grand Artisan tier frame" class="tier-frame tier-frame-art" style="background-image:var(--art-tier-frame-large-grand-artisan)"></span><img id="row-image" alt="profile avatar" loading="lazy" width="120" height="120" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="profile-avatar-image" style="color:transparent" src="https://static-cdn.jtvnw.net/user-default-pictures-uv/294c98b5-e34d-42cd-a8f0-140b72fba9b0-profile_image-150x150.png"/></div><div class="author-info"><div class="author-header-container"><div class="name-and-tags"><div class="author-name"><a aria-label="View TheArchitects777&#x27;s profile" href="/members/thearchitects777">TheArchitects777</a></div><div class="author-tags"><div class=" tag new-tag reversed">Owner</div><div class=" tooltip-wrapper tier-badge-icon-wrapper"><img class="tier-badge-icon" src="/images/legends/grand-artisan-icon.svg" alt="Grand Artisan tier icon"/></div></div></div></div><div class="author-description"><ul class="details"><li><div class="amount">84</div><div class="title">Followers</div></li><li><div class="amount">47</div><div class="title">Projects</div></li><li><div class="amount">37.1M</div><div class="title">Downloads</div></li></ul></div></div><div class="author-buttons"><button class=" btn-secondary btn-follow followed"><svg id="icon-heart" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M9.6941 16.9374C9.62723 16.9127 9.53909 16.8717 9.49824 16.8463C9.42695 16.802 8.95707 16.3331 8.09859 15.4496C7.87709 15.2216 7.51874 14.8535 7.30226 14.6316C7.08578 14.4097 6.37073 13.6734 5.71326 12.9954C4.58389 11.8845 3.25642 10.4905 2.48892 9.36636C2.13406 8.65228 1.99699 8.02266 2.0228 7.22523C2.03618 6.81185 2.07224 6.5603 2.16992 6.19884C2.5997 4.60848 3.87669 3.40511 5.47619 3.08321C5.70034 3.0381 5.80914 3.03061 6.24425 3.03031C6.68463 3.03 6.78594 3.03699 7.01613 3.08359C7.36409 