%252flootr-compatibility-pack-for-betterend-fabric%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"\u003eLootr Compatibility Pack for BetterEnd Fabric Minecraft Data Pack (planetminecraft.com)\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAn example of the cities can be seen below:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://static.planetminecraft.com/files/image/minecraft/data-pack/2022/896/15572481-betterendcitiesthumbnail_l.webp\" alt=\"Example of BetterEnd Better End Cities\" width=\"800\" height=\"506\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAlso try\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bigger-better-end-cities\" rel=\"nofollow\"\u003eBigger Better End Cities - Mods - Minecraft - CurseForge\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTo have much bigger cities.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003eIf a datapack version of this mod is preferable, it can be found here:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-end-city-for-better-end\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"\u003ehttps://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-end-city-for-better-end\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor a version for Vanilla try:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-end-cities-vanilla\" rel=\"nofollow\"\u003eBetter End Cities Vanilla - Mods - Minecraft - CurseForge\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e36:[[\"$\",\"$Lae\",null,{}],\"$Laf\",[\"$\",\"$Lb0\",null,{\"description\":\"$b1\",\"showHeader\":false}],[\"$\",\"$Lb2\",null,{}],[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"shelf\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"inner\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\" shelf-title-group shelf-title-group-right\",\"children\":[\"More from TheArc